(docs/BUGS_FOUND.md #155: inside a function, a file opened under a buffer
 parameter's name, or under a top-level buffer's name, is refused as it is
 for a number.)

a buffer called cupboard is "ab".

To 'stock up' with a buffer called shelf.
    open a file called shelf for writing at "shelf.txt",
    Close shelf.
    Print "size {shelf's size}".

To restock.
    open a file called cupboard for writing at "cupboard.txt".
    Close cupboard.

'stock up' of cupboard.
restock.
